    "justification": "This strict-separation corollary of the pooled-information equivalence is non-definitional: the source-by-cell precision incidence, rather than a pooled effective sample size, controls inference.",
    "gap": "Published multi-source efficiency formulas do not exhibit two collection-only encouragement designs matched on scalar summaries but separated by the support-constrained residual program.",
    "consumer": "Trial portfolio design must match precise sources to target cells rather than report only total enrollment or a Kish effective size.",
    "proof_tex": "The causal, randomization, consistency, transport, support, mass, and balance checks are the same direct checks as for the split family. Every source has receipt contrast \\(\\mu_n\\) and outcome contrast zero, so \\(\\mu_D=\\mu_n\\) and \\(\\theta_T=0\\). For a source with noise label \\(q_s\\),\n\\[\n \\operatorname{Var}(Y\\mid Z=z)=\\frac{q_s}{4},\\qquad\n q_{sx}(0)=q_s,\\qquad\n q_{sx}(\\theta)=q_s+2\\theta^2\\mu_n(1-\\mu_n)\\ge q_s.\n\\]\nThus \\(v_0\\le q_L\\) verifies residual regularity and both laws belong to \\(\\mathcal M_{4n}\\).\n\nFor one cell covered by two sources with prices \\(q\\) and \\(q'\\), minimizing\n\\(qa^2/n+q'(1/2-a)^2/n\\) gives\n\\[\n \\frac1{4n}\\frac{qq'}{q+q'}.\n\\]\nIn design \\(A\\), the two prices on each cell are equal, so the optimal mass is split equally and\n\\[\n V_{\\mathrm{coll}}(P_n^A,0)=\\frac{q_L+q_H}{8n}.\n\\]\nIn design \\(B\\), each cell receives one low-price and one high-price source, whence\n\\[\n V_{\\mathrm{coll}}(P_n^B,0)\n =2\\left\\{\\frac1{4n}\\frac{q_Lq_H}{q_L+q_H}\\right\\}\n =\\frac{q_Lq_H}{2n(q_L+q_H)}.\n\\]\nSubtracting gives\n\\[\n V_{\\mathrm{coll}}(P_n^A,0)-V_{\\mathrm{coll}}(P_n^B,0)\n =\\frac{(q_H-q_L)^2}{8n(q_L+q_H)}>0.\n\\]\nAll listed scalar summaries coincide by construction. The pooled-information theorem turns this variance inequality into strict inequalities of exact information, collection strength, and strong-branch length benchmark. Therefore a reduction retaining only those summaries takes the same value on two experiments having different information and cannot represent both. The differing datum is precisely the incidence of price with cell support.",
